recentPreviews.summary:
The fast deploy loop skips lint and runs the debug variant, and it never builds the PR merged onto main. Those gaps account for most CI failures that passed locally in the last three weeks:
• Kotlin compile errors that only appear after the merge with main;
• ExtraTranslation lint errors;
• unit tests that fail only in testReleaseUnitTest;
• Co-Authored-By bot trailers.

On a GitHub-hosted runner, "Compile APK and Android tests" hits its 45-minute limit before the unit tests run. The Windows launcher services are rebuilt from scratch on every run:
• the Ubisoft service took 1519 s in run 45338233890;
• the Rockstar launchers were cancelled at the limit after 1124 s.

