Discord shows the Updates tab is how most testers get builds, and the same problems keep coming up:
• people can't get back to an earlier Preview build;
• PR test builds made before a versionCode bump won't install;
• people test an older revision of a PR without knowing it;
• nobody can tell which PR, commit or author a build came from.
